{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"60aad6cc09533cd2c61e64e9407224f6e87c406849cf3cf6949fdae5ee2e006b","digest":{"component_or_area":"examples/claude-skills documentation and reference materials","key_entities":["examples/claude-skills/","rebar-brainstorm","rebar-debug","rebar-implement","rebar-janitor","SKILL.md","README.md","Gerrit","src/"],"problem_keywords":["documentation","examples","claude code skills","agent workflows","rebar integration"],"propositions":["Contributors lack concrete, self-contained examples showing how agents can use rebar for planning, implementing, debugging, and maintaining code.","Four Claude Code skill examples (rebar-brainstorm, rebar-debug, rebar-implement, rebar-janitor) must be added under examples/claude-skills/ with SKILL.md files and supporting references.","All example content must be self-contained with no personal identifiers, host names, absolute paths, secrets, or environment-specific data.","The rebar-implement skill's review-and-land workflow must defer to project documentation and Gerrit/rebar as the default system of record."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785824850491306871,"uuid":"33ef89cc-8209-4e9c-8272-8bfc38d4888e"}